      "question_html": "<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Write the full electron configuration of a sulfur atom.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Write the full electron configuration of a Ca<sup>2+</sup> ion.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(c)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Define the term first ionisation energy.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(1)</span></div>",
