    "content": {
      "question_html": "<p>The initial rate of the reaction A + B → C was measured in three experiments.</p>\n<table class=\"q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Experiment</th><th>[A] / mol dm<sup>−3</sup></th><th>[B] / mol dm<sup>−3</sup></th><th>Initial rate / mol dm<sup>−3</sup> s<sup>−1</sup></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>0.10</td><td>0.10</td><td>2.0 × 10<sup>−4</sup></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>0.20</td><td>0.10</td><td>4.0 × 10<sup>−4</sup></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>0.20</td><td>0.20</td><td>1.6 × 10<sup>−3</sup></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Determine the order of reaction with respect to A and with respect to B.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(2)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Write the rate equation.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(c)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Calculate the rate constant, k, and give its units.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(3)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">First order with respect to A: doubling [A] doubles the rate</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Second order with respect to B: doubling [B] quadruples the rate</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">rate = k[A][B]<sup>2</sup></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(c)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">k = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">2.0 × 10<sup>−4</sup></span><span class=\"frac__d\">0.10 × 0.10<sup>2</sup></span></span></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">k = 0.20</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">dm<sup>6</sup> mol<sup>−2</sup> s<sup>−1</sup></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
    }
  },
