    "content": {
      "question_html": "<p>Standard electrode potentials: Zn<sup>2+</sup>/Zn = −0.76 V, Cu<sup>2+</sup>/Cu = +0.34 V, Ag<sup>+</sup>/Ag = +0.80 V.</p>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Calculate the standard cell potential of a zinc–copper cell.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Write the overall equation for the reaction in this cell.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(c)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Predict, with a reason, whether silver ions will oxidise copper metal.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(2)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(d)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Give two reasons why a reaction predicted to be feasible may not be observed.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(2)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">0.34 − (−0.76) = 1.10 V</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Zn + Cu<sup>2+</sup> → Zn<sup>2+</sup> + Cu</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(c)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Yes: the Ag<sup>+</sup>/Ag potential is more positive than Cu<sup>2+</sup>/Cu</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">So Ag<sup>+</sup> gains electrons and Cu is oxidised (cell potential +0.46 V)</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(d)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">The activation energy may be high, so the reaction is too slow</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Conditions may not be standard, for example the concentrations are not 1 mol dm<sup>−3</sup></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
    }
  },
